(p/'photography'/'index.html').write_text(doc('Photography',photography))
conservation=lead('CONSERVATION / IMPACT','A story can change what we protect.','Nature protection begins with attention: to species, to places, and to the communities that know them best.')+section('DOCUMENTED WORK','In the field.',simple('Wildlife Wonders','A film raising awareness of biodiversity and conservation in Tunisia, made with Zakher Bouragaoui.',S['wildlife'],'BIODIVERSITY')+simple('Blue Future','The Tunisian chapter highlights Rania’s ecotourism initiative and local livelihoods along the northern coast.',S['blue'],'MEDITERRANEAN')+simple('Protected areas','Rabii described filming work related to the IUCN Green List across Tunisia, Morocco, Lebanon and France in a 2022 interview. Project credits and footage still need confirmation.',S['story'],'INTERVIEW / 2022'))+f'<div class="wide-visual"><img src="/assets/ain-draham.jpg" alt="Aïn Draham forest in Tunisia"><a class="image-credit" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Forest_A%C3%AFn_Draham.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Aïn Draham · Smailtn · CC0 · editorial image ↗</a></div>'
